# Settings objects (gui-design.md: these settings are objects themselves,
# like OS/2's System, Sound and Mouse objects and the Scheme Palette): one
# of each per user, kept centrally in the System Setup folder. Each
# subclass declares its settings as properties (stored as text in the
# WPSetup state), and the GUI reads them all (wpQuerySettings).
class WPSetup : WPAbstract
version 1.0
method wpQuerySettings() -> string
method wpSetSetting(string key, string value) -> bool
override wpModifyPopupMenu
